Issue #4715: a move that motion rejects (here a soft limit) aborts the
program with an error, but the interpreter had already read ahead past it,
here to a G56 G19 and the M2 that resets to G54 G17. The abort left those
modes active although the machine never reached them. This sets G55 G18 in
MDI, runs test.ngc and checks that G55 G18 are active after the error, as
after an operator abort.
